OL,3,ALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour wins the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, with the Greens coming in
OL,9,Fsecond - here's how the night unfolded
OL,11,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali -
OL,12,Fwho secured 45% of the vote - says it
OL,13,Fis an "extraordinary honour" to
OL,14,Frepresent the constituency, which has
OL,15,Fbeen Labour since it was created in
OL,16,F1983
OL,18,FPolanski says he will "of course" carry
OL,19,Fon as leader of the Greens - and that
OL,20,Fhis party is "more of an electoral
OL,21,Fthreat in these seats than we've ever
OL,22,Fbeen before"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
