OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is a risk of people being
OL,8,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism, an
OL,9,Fofficial review in England says
OL,11,FThe review, which looked at people of
OL,12,Fall ages, particularly focuses on young
OL,13,Fpeople and children who have the
OL,14,Fhighest rates of diagnoses
OL,16,FThe report was commissioned by former
OL,17,Fhealth secretary Wes Streeting after he
OL,18,Fsaid there was an "over-diagnosis" of
OL,19,Fmental health conditions
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
