SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791533887
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to Radio 4's Today programme,
OL,8,Freview chair Prof Peter Fonagy says
OL,9,FStreeting was "with respect, completely
OL,10,Fwrong"
OL,12,FHis findings show that "there has been
OL,13,Fa rise in distress and mental ill
OL,14,Fhealth amongst young people which is
OL,15,Fvery, very real," he says, adding
OL,16,Fmental health distress in 25-year-olds
OL,17,Fis up by 50% since 1993
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
