OL,3,ASuspect linked to Monaco bomb attack on
OL,4,Amillionaire speaks to BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Ukrainian security services
OL,7,Fofficer linked to a bomb attack in
OL,8,FMonaco in June that targeted a
OL,9,Fmulti-millionaire says he believed it
OL,10,Fwas authorised by senior members of
OL,11,FHUR, Ukraine's military intelligence
OL,12,Fagency.
OL,14,FIn an exclusive interview with the BBC
OL,15,Ffrom prison in Kyiv, facilitated by his
OL,16,Flawyer, Vitalii Zhykovych has given his
OL,17,Fown account of the attempted
OL,18,Fassassination for the first time.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
