OL,3,ASuspect linked to Monaco bomb attack on
OL,4,Amillionaire speaks to BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian-born businessman Vadym
OL,7,FYermolayev and his 13-year-old son were
OL,8,Fbadly hurt in the blast and his partner
OL,9,Fsuffered catastrophic injuries.
OL,10,FYermolayev later described their
OL,11,Fsurvival as "nothing short of a
OL,12,Fmiracle".
OL,14,FZhykovych describes himself as a
OL,15,F"freelancer" for Ukraine's SBU security
OL,16,Fservice and says Anastasia Berezovska,
OL,17,Fthe woman caught on camera planting the
OL,18,Fbomb in Monaco, was his "agent".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
