OL,3,AToxic smog shuts schools in Malaysia as
OL,4,Apollution hits record levels in
OL,5,ASingapore
OL,6,
OL,7,FWildfires have been burning throughout
OL,8,Fparts of Indonesia for weeks, sending
OL,9,Fsmoke across the country and into
OL,10,Fneighbouring Malaysia, Singapore and
OL,11,Fthe Philippines
OL,13,FThe smog, also known as the haze, has
OL,14,Fcaused record levels of air pollution
OL,15,Fin Singapore as it kicks off the F1
OL,16,FGrand Prix race today
OL,18,FAuthorities in several states across
OL,19,FMalaysia have also ordered schools to
OL,20,Fshut
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
