OL,3,AToxic smog shuts schools in Malaysia as
OL,4,Apollution hits record levels in
OL,5,ASingapore
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis year's wildfire season is one of
OL,8,FIndonesia's worst in years, and is
OL,9,Fprimarily caused by illegal
OL,10,Fslash-and-burn practices used by
OL,11,Ffarmers and companies as a cheap method
OL,12,Fto clear vegetation
OL,14,FBetween July and September, Indonesia's
OL,15,FHealth Ministry recorded nearly 175,000
OL,16,Fcases of respiratory infections linked
OL,17,Fto fires. Experts say the "super" El
OL,18,FNino this year has exacerbated drought
OL,19,Fconditions
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
